    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The Apatani Farming System in Ziro Valley is frequently asked in exams for its unique UNESCO-recognized paddy-cum-fish culture without reliance on modern machinery.",
        "Hydropower projects on key river basins (Subansiri, Siang, Kameng, Dibang) are major topics in North-East infrastructure and geography questions.",
        "Jhum cultivation concepts often test ecological impacts, soil fertility management, and traditional crop rotation cycles."
